{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265ylBSE1VHI1795254922.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有團體舉辦免費健康檢測活動，有逾400名市民參與。</p><p></p><p>活動由壽臣山獅子會主辦，於大圍一間中學舉行，為50歲或以上市民提供超聲波骨質疏鬆檢測、基礎聽力測試及認知功能評估。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HEALTH-1630_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zZzY0pYOyO1795254936.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另外，亦透過人工智能(AI)檢測眼底，評估健康。</p><p></p><p>主辦機構指，過往的社區檢測發現，有七成半參加者出現不同程度的骨質健康問題，希望透過及早檢查以減低風險。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:43:50.653252+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T22:52:56.630406+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:37:14.908432+00:00","content_hash":"2c61786304a92e07a72d8d317ba73e3745e200dff7fa0ad02528de593b249bce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:43:50.653252+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}